"including the way to opt out of caching."
msgstr ""
"详见 [Cached task](../reference/cached-task.md) 参考，包括如何选择不缓存。"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:94
msgid "Migration away from IntegrationTest"
msgstr "从 IntegrationTest 迁移"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:97
msgid ""
"To migrate away from the `IntegrationTest` configuration, create a separate "
"subproject and implement it as normal test."
msgstr ""
"要从 `IntegrationTest` 配置迁移，请创建单独的子项目并作为普通测试实现。"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:99
msgid "Migrating to slash syntax"
msgstr "迁移到斜杠语法"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:102
msgid ""
"sbt 1.x supported both the sbt 0.13 style syntax and the slash syntax. sbt "
"2.x removes the support for the sbt 0.13 syntax, so use the slash syntax for "
"both sbt shell and in `build.sbt`:"
msgstr ""
"sbt 1.x 同时支持 sbt 0.13 风格语法和斜杠语法。sbt 2.x 移除了对 sbt 0.13 语法"
"的支持，请在 sbt shell 和 `build.sbt` 中均使用斜杠语法："

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:108
msgid ""
"For example, `test:compile` will no longer work on the shell. Use `Test/"
"compile` instead. See [syntactic Scalafix rule for unified slash syntax]"
"(https://eed3si9n.com/syntactic-scalafix-rule-for-unified-slash-syntax/) for "
"semi-automated migration of `build.sbt` files."
msgstr ""
"例如，`test:compile` 在 shell 中不再有效。请改用 `Test/compile`。有关 "
"`build.sbt` 文件的半自动迁移，请参阅 [syntactic Scalafix rule for unified "
"slash syntax](https://eed3si9n.com/syntactic-scalafix-rule-for-unified-slash-"
"syntax/)。"

