#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:187
msgid "The PluginCompat technique"
msgstr "PluginCompat 技术"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:190
msgid ""
"To use the same `*.scala` source but target both sbt 1.x and 2.x, we can "
"create a shim, for example an object named `PluginCompat` in both `src/main/"
"scala-2.12/` and `src/main/scala-3/`."
msgstr ""
"要使用相同的 `*.scala` 源但同时针对 sbt 1.x 和 2.x，我们可以创建适配层，例如"
"在 `src/main/scala-2.12/` 和 `src/main/scala-3/` 中均创建名为 `PluginCompat` "
"的对象。"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:192
msgid "Migrating Classpath type"
msgstr "迁移 Classpath 类型"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:194
msgid ""
"sbt 2.x changed the `Classpath` type to be an alias of the "
"`Seq[Attributed[xsbti.HashedVirtualFileRef]]` type. The following is a shim "
"created to work with classpaths from both sbt 1.x and 2.x."
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x 将 `Classpath` 类型改为 "
"`Seq[Attributed[xsbti.HashedVirtualFileRef]]` 类型的别名。以下是为同时兼容 "
"sbt 1.x 和 2.x 的 classpath 创建的适配层。"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:197
msgid "// src/main/scala-3/PluginCompat.scala"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:220
msgid "and here's for sbt 1.x:"
msgstr "以下是 sbt 1.x 的版本："

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:223
msgid "// src/main/scala-2.12/PluginCompat.scala"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:242
msgid "// This adds `Def.uncached(...)`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:249
msgid ""
"Now we can import `PluginCompat.*` and use `toNioPaths(...)` etc to absorb "
"the differences between sbt 1.x and 2.x. The above demonstrates how we can "
"absorb the classpath type change, and convert it into a vector of NIO Paths."
msgstr ""
"现在我们可以导入 `PluginCompat.*` 并使用 `toNioPaths(...)` 等来吸收 sbt 1.x "
"与 2.x 之间的差异。以上演示了如何吸收 classpath 类型变更，并将其转换为 NIO "
"Path 的向量。"
